{"id": "t080-001", "text": "Spoke to Kieran after work. His dad's hip replacement is booked for 14 May at the Royal, and he's already dreading the drive up and down every day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after work"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 May", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the drive up and down every day", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t080-002", "text": "Mehmet's band are playing the Fleece on Friday at 9pm. He's on bass now, apparently, not guitar.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "playing the Fleece", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 9pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bass", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t080-003", "text": "Called Bethany. Her nan passed away on Sunday morning. The funeral is on the 3rd of June at 11am in Truro. Remind me to send flowers to her mum's house before then.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd of June at 11am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers to her mum's house", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t080-004", "text": "Stefan was made redundant yesterday. He seemed oddly calm about it, said he'd seen it coming since March.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "calm", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since March"}]}
{"id": "t080-005", "text": "Emeka is running the Bristol half on 21/09. He's been training with his brother Hamza most mornings. Need to text him good luck the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emeka", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Bristol half", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "21/09", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "most mornings"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t080-006", "text": "Francesca's knee surgery went well. She's home now but on crutches for at least six weeks, and very bored.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "on crutches", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "at least six weeks"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "bored", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t080-007", "text": "Picked up the prescription and booked my own dentist check-up for Thursday at 4:15.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dentist check-up", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 4:15", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t080-008", "text": "Lunch with Mohammed. His daughter has her grade 5 piano recital on 12 July at 2pm, and he wants me to come along. He's more nervous than she is.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "grade 5 piano recital", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "12 July at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t080-009", "text": "Samir and Isla have split up. It sounds mutual, but Isla is staying with her sister for a while. Don't forget to check in with Isla next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a while"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with Isla", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t080-010", "text": "Thabo's mum is in hospital with pneumonia. He's flying back to Johannesburg tomorrow evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pneumonia", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back to Johannesburg", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow evening", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t080-011", "text": "Caitlin has an audition for the Cheltenham youth orchestra on Saturday morning. She's been practising the Elgar for weeks and is really anxious about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "audition for the Cheltenham youth orchestra", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "weeks"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t080-012", "text": "Jen's cat Pickle had a lump removed on Tuesday. All clear, thankfully, and Pickle is back to stealing ham.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pickle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lump removed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t080-013", "text": "Imogen says the play is the 18th, 19th and 20th of October, all at 7:30. She's playing the stepmother. Must book tickets for the Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "play", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th, 19th and 20th of October, all at 7:30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "playing the stepmother", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book tickets", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t080-014", "text": "Ahmed was let go from the bank on Friday afternoon along with half his team. He's trying to stay positive but he's clearly rattled. I should take him for a pint at some point this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "let go from the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to stay positive", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "rattled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a pint", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "some point this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t080-015", "text": "Bumped into Ethan and his wife at the shops. Their son Alfie starts physio for his ankle on Monday at 8am.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alfie", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio for his ankle", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday at 8am", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t080-016", "text": "Nikolai lost his grandfather last month. He's been quiet since. He mentioned his grandfather taught him chess, so maybe that's why he's stopped playing online.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikolai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandfather", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "quiet", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandfather", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "chess", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t080-017", "text": "Ryan's five-a-side team made the league final. It's next Wednesday at 6:30 at Goals. He's playing in goal because their keeper Malik broke his wrist last month and is still in a cast until 1 November. Ryan says he's useless in goal and fully expects to lose. Remind me to ask Ryan how it went on Thursday morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "five-a-side", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "league final", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wednesday at 6:30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "keeper", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke his wrist", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in a cast", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until 1 November"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Ryan how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t080-018", "text": "Leah had her gallbladder out this morning. Her partner Kwame says she's groggy but fine. Remind me to call her on Friday afternoon to see how she's feeling.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gallbladder out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "groggy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t080-019", "text": "Kwame is doing the Three Peaks challenge on 6 August for the hospice that looked after his dad. I need to sponsor him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Three Peaks challenge", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 August", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sponsor him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t080-020", "text": "Eduardo got dumped over text. Over text! Luis and I are taking him out on Saturday night to cheer him up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eduardo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dumped", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking him out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday night", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t080-021", "text": "Gintaras plays in a brass band and they're competing at the regional championships in Blackpool on 15/11. He plays the euphonium, which I had to look up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gintaras", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "brass band", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "regional championships in Blackpool", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "15/11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "euphonium", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t080-022", "text": "Alejandro's mother's funeral is on Thursday the 9th at 2pm. His sister Manon is flying in from Seville the day before. I should ask whether they need anyone to help with the wake.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alejandro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday the 9th at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Manon", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Seville", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask whether they need anyone to help with the wake", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wake", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t080-023", "text": "Ava has a scan at the Princess Anne on Monday morning. She didn't say what for and I didn't push.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan at the Princess Anne", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday morning", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t080-024", "text": "Hamza is obsessed with Formula 1 at the moment. He keeps saying he'd love a day at Silverstone, which would make a brilliant birthday present.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Formula 1", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a day at Silverstone", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t080-025", "text": "Had a long call with Malik. His uncle had a stroke on Saturday and is still in intensive care. Malik's driving to Leicester every evening after work and running on empty. His boss has been decent about it, which helps. Remind me to text him tomorrow, and maybe drop some food round at the weekend so he doesn't have to cook.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "uncle", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stroke", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in intensive care", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening after work"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "running on empty", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop some food round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t080-026", "text": "Karan's choir concert has been cancelled because the church roof is leaking. He's gutted, they'd rehearsed for months.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "choir", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "months"}]}
{"id": "t080-027", "text": "Vikram is having his wisdom teeth out on 2nd December. He's asked if I can drive him home afterwards, which is fine. I'm picking him up at 1pm.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vikram", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wisdom teeth out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2nd December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "1pm"}]}
{"id": "t080-028", "text": "Elijah won his chess tournament in Reading! First place in the under-18 section, and he beat the top seed in the final round after nearly four hours. His mum was over the moon and his little brother Karan made him a medal out of foil. He's now hoping to get picked for the county team. I should send him a congratulations card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chess tournament in Reading", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after nearly four hours"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "little brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karan", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "hoping to get picked for the county team", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a congratulations card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t080-029", "text": "Manon mentioned she's vegetarian and allergic to cashews. Worth remembering for the dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Manon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to cashews", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t080-030", "text": "Coffee with Isla. She's still struggling after the breakup with Samir, especially now he's moved his stuff out. She's started running in the evenings, which seems to help. She's entered a 10k on 28 September. Ask her how her training is going next time.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "running", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the evenings"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "10k", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "28 September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her how her training is going", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next time", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t080-031", "text": "Note to self: renew the car insurance before 30/06 and get the boiler serviced.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "renew the car insurance", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before 30/06", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get the boiler serviced", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t080-032", "text": "Stefan's leaving drinks were meant to be on Friday but he's called them off. He says he isn't in the mood after the redundancy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't in the mood", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t080-033", "text": "Kieran's dad's operation was yesterday. Need to ask Kieran how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Kieran how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t080-034", "text": "Mehmet's wife Leah is having her ankle pinned on the 23rd at 8am. Their twins will be with her parents for the week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leah", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ankle pinned", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 23rd at 8am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week"}]}
{"id": "t080-035", "text": "Spoke to Bethany again. The funeral went as well as these things can. Her mum is not coping well and Bethany is staying down there until the end of the month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not coping well", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying down there", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the end of the month", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t080-036", "text": "Emeka finished the half in 1:52! A personal best by four minutes. I should send him a congratulations message.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emeka", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "half", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a congratulations message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t080-037", "text": "Francesca loves Agatha Christie and she's working her way through them all while she recovers. Could get her a nice box set.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Agatha Christie", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "while she recovers"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get her a nice box set", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t080-038", "text": "Mohammed's daughter was brilliant at the recital on Saturday. She played the Chopin without a single slip and got a standing ovation from the grandparents' row. Mohammed cried, obviously, and filmed the whole thing at a strange angle. Her teacher thinks she should go for grade 6 in the spring. I should send him a card for her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recital", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandparents", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "teacher", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "grade 6", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a card for her", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t080-039", "text": "Thabo texted from Johannesburg. His mum is out of hospital but needs a few weeks of rest at home, and his sister can't take more time off, so he's staying until 4 March at least. He's working remotely but the time difference isn't the issue, it's the internet. He sounded tired. Need to call him on Sunday at about 6pm our time.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "rest at home", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until 4 March at least", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "working remotely", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "tired", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at about 6pm our time", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t080-040", "text": "Big week. Tuesday at 10am is my appraisal, Wednesday evening I've got the plumber, and Saturday is the Hamilton matinee with Mum.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday at 10am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appraisal", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday evening", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "plumber", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Hamilton matinee", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}]}
{"id": "t080-041", "text": "Caitlin got into the orchestra! Rehearsals start on the 7th at half 6.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the orchestra", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Rehearsals", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 7th at half 6", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t080-042", "text": "Ahmed has two interviews lined up already, one on Monday at 11 and one on Thursday afternoon. Remind me to wish him luck on Sunday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interviews", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday at 11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "wish him luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t080-043", "text": "Ethan is training for an Ironman in Copenhagen next August. He's vegan and swims at 6am most days, which sounds miserable.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Ironman in Copenhagen", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next August", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "swims", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "6am most days"}]}
{"id": "t080-044", "text": "Imogen said opening night was a disaster. A whole wall of the set fell over in the second act, the lead forgot his lines, and the fire alarm went off during the interval. Somehow the reviews have been kind, and the Saturday show has sold out. She's exhausted and says she needs a week of sleep after closing night on the 20th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "opening night", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Saturday show", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "closing night", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 20th", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t080-045", "text": "Ryan's mum is having a cataract operation on 17 April at 9:30. Ryan can't get the day off, so his brother Ethan is taking her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cataract operation", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "17 April at 9:30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t080-046", "text": "Leah and Kwame are moving to Leeds in the spring. Kwame's got a job at the university there.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at the university", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}]}
{"id": "t080-047", "text": "Jen's brother Stefan, the one in Glasgow, was made redundant this morning. Jen is furious on his behalf because he'd only been there eighteen months and they'd just relocated him. He's got a mortgage and a baby due in January, so it's terrible timing. Don't forget to ask Jen how Stefan is doing at the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Glasgow", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "furious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "eighteen months"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "mortgage", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Jen how Stefan is doing", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t080-048", "text": "Gintaras's band came second at the championships in Blackpool, which is the best they've ever done. He said the test piece was brutal and two of the cornets were off with flu, so they had to borrow players from another band the night before. He's thrilled and already talking about the nationals next year, which would be in Cheltenham in September.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gintaras", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "championships in Blackpool", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nationals", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t080-049", "text": "Hamza's dad passed away in the early hours of Tuesday. The janazah is tomorrow at 1pm at the mosque on Green Lane. I must go. I should also ask Malik whether people are collecting for the family.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the early hours of Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "janazah", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow at 1pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Malik whether people are collecting for the family", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t080-050", "text": "Eduardo's doing much better. He's joined a climbing gym with Luis and seems to have mostly stopped checking her Instagram.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eduardo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing much better", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "climbing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t080-051", "text": "Alejandro wanted to say thank you for coming to the funeral. He's going back to work on Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alejandro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t080-052", "text": "Elijah's next tournament is in Birmingham on 3rd of August. His mum is driving him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tournament", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3rd of August", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t080-053", "text": "Manon is running the London marathon next April for a cancer charity. She lost her aunt last year. She said she's terrified about the training, and that her knees are already complaining. Remind me to sponsor her on payday, the 25th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Manon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "London marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified about the training", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "knees are already complaining", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sponsor her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "payday, the 25th", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t080-054", "text": "Vikram's back home and complaining that he can only eat soup. Ice cream's allowed, though.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vikram", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t080-055", "text": "Dinner with Nikolai and his girlfriend Ava. Ava has an appendix scar from surgery in the summer and showed everyone, unprompted. Nikolai seems happier than last month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikolai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "appendix scar", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikolai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "happier", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month"}]}
{"id": "t080-056", "text": "Karan says the choir has rescheduled the concert for 14 December at 7pm in the town hall instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "choir", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "concert", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 December at 7pm", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t080-057", "text": "Dentist moved my appointment to the 10th at 8:40. Need to tell work I'll be in late.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appointment", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to the 10th at 8:40", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "tell work I'll be in late", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t080-058", "text": "Ava told me the scan was fine. She'd been worried it was something serious and hadn't slept properly in a fortnight, but it's just a cyst and they'll keep an eye on it. She has a follow-up appointment on 14/01 at 10:20, and her husband is going with her this time. She's planning a weekend in the Lakes to celebrate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cyst", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "follow-up appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "14/01 at 10:20", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "weekend in the Lakes", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t080-059", "text": "Samir's grandmother died on 2 November. He's flying to Karachi on Friday morning for the funeral and will be away for two weeks. His manager has been really understanding. I should message him on Thursday night before he goes, and remind me to check on his flat while he's away. He asked me to water the plants.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Karachi", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday night", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before he goes", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check on his flat", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "while he's away", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t080-060", "text": "Mrs Evans next door had her hip done on Monday. Her son Kieran is visiting each evening. Must take her round some of the lemon drizzle.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Evans", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip done", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "each evening"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her round some of the lemon drizzle", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}]}
